  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Right now we are running into issue with Tomcat reindexing process for our 3.8 million indexcat akurbra items. our server have regular bi-weekly server patching and will cause Tomcat to restart, and everytime it does that the whole process would restart all over. If there’s a way to allow Tomcat restart and resume reindexing that would be helpful in our migration progress with large numbers of items",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
